// Undecided exhaustiveness is not exhaustiveness: coverage fails closed (DESIGN 5 -- a failure arm
// refuses, never widens), and the refusal names its own reason rather than the non-exhaustive one,
// because the relation did not decide the arms wrong; it could not decide them.
